{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用二维动态规划表示两个前缀之间的编辑距离：dp[i][j] 是 horse 的前 i 个字符变成 ros 的前 j 个字符所需的最少操作数。字符相同时直接继承左上角；字符不同时，从删除、插入、替换三种来源的最小值加 1。动画逐格计算示例矩阵，最终右下角得到答案 3。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>编辑距离动态规划</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55}main{width:100%;max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 24px 48px}.panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:10px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px}h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff}p{margin:8px 0}.mono,.cell,.char{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.words{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}.word{flex:1;min-width:240px;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:8px;padding:14px}.word strong{color:#3794ff}.chars{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}.char{min-width:38px;padding:7px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:5px;background:#1c1c1c}.rule{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:14px}.rule-card{padding:12px;border:1px solid #454545;border-radius:7px;background:#2d2d30}.rule-card b{color:#3794ff}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;padding:6px 0 10px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:58px repeat(4,minmax(58px,1fr));gap:7px;min-width:360px}.cell{min-height:62px;border:1px solid #555;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,color .35s}.cell .label{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#9cdcfe}.cell.header{background:#333337;color:#fff}.cell.done{border-color:#3794ff}.cell.current{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}.cell.source{background:#384b5c;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.answer{background:#0e639c;border:2px solid #3794ff;color:#fff}.status{min-height:76px;margin-top:18px;padding:14px 16px;border-left:4px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:4px}.status strong{color:#3794ff}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:14px;font-size:13px}.dot{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;margin-right:6px;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:-2px;border:1px solid #3794ff}.dot.current{background:#0e639c}.dot.source{background:#384b5c}@media(max-width:620px){main{padding:18px 12px}.rule{grid-template-columns:1fr}.panel{padding:15px}.cell{min-height:56px}}/* COMPACT */ body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}main{max-width:560px!important;padding:8px 10px 10px!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}p{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:4px 0!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.word{padding:8px 10px!important;min-width:0!important;flex:1 1 100%!important}.chars .char{width:38px!important;min-height:48px!important;padding:4px 2px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:14px!important}.rule{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:6px!important}.rule-card{padding:8px 10px!important;font-size:12px!important}.grid{grid-template-columns:42px repeat(4,38px)!important;gap:4px!important;min-width:0!important}.cell{min-height:44px!important;border-radius:4px!important;border-width:1px!important;font-size:12px!important}.cell .label{font-size:10px!important}.status{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;min-height:auto!important;font-size:12px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n#grid{grid-template-columns:42px repeat(4,68px)!important}#grid .label{white-space:nowrap}</style></head><body><main><section class=\"panel\"><h1>把前缀问题排成一张表</h1><p><span class=\"mono\">dp[i][j]</span> 表示 <span class=\"mono\">horse</span> 的前 <span class=\"mono\">i</span> 个字符，变成 <span class=\"mono\">ros</span> 的前 <span class=\"mono\">j</span> 个字符所需的最少操作数。</p><div class=\"words\"><div class=\"word\"><strong>源字符串 word1</strong><div class=\"chars\"><span class=\"char\">h</span><span class=\"char\">o</span><span class=\"char\">r</span><span class=\"char\">s</span><span class=\"char\">e</span></div></div><div class=\"word\"><strong>目标字符串 word2</strong><div class=\"chars\"><span class=\"char\">r</span><span class=\"char\">o</span><span class=\"char\">s</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"panel\"><h1>每个格子的三个候选来源</h1><div class=\"rule\"><div class=\"rule-card\"><b>删除</b><br><span class=\"mono\">dp[i-1][j] + 1</span></div><div class=\"rule-card\"><b>插入</b><br><span class=\"mono\">dp[i][j-1] + 1</span></div><div class=\"rule-card\"><b>替换</b><br><span class=\"mono\">dp[i-1][j-1] + 1</span></div></div><p>若当前两个字符相同，则不需要新操作，直接取左上角的值。</p></section><section class=\"panel\"><h1>示例 1：逐格计算</h1><div class=\"table-wrap\"><div id=\"grid\" class=\"grid\"></div></div><div id=\"status\" class=\"status\">准备初始化空前缀。</div><div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot current\"></i>正在计算</span><span><i class=\"dot source\"></i>候选来源</span></div></section></main><script>const a='horse',b='ros',rows=a.length+1,cols=b.length+1,dp=Array.from({length:rows},()=>Array(cols).fill(0));const grid=document.getElementById('grid'),status=document.getElementById('status'),cells={};function add(text,cls,key,label){const x=document.createElement('div');x.className='cell '+cls;x.innerHTML='<span>'+text+'</span>'+(label?'<span class=\"label\">'+label+'</span>':'');grid.appendChild(x);if(key)cells[key]=x}add('i \\\\ j','header');for(let j=0;j<cols;j++)add(j===0?'∅':b[j-1],'header',null,'j='+j);for(let i=0;i<rows;i++){add(i===0?'∅':a[i-1],'header',null,'i='+i);for(let j=0;j<cols;j++)add('·','',i+'-'+j,'dp['+i+']['+j+']')}const steps=[];for(let i=0;i<rows;i++){for(let j=0;j<cols;j++){if(i===0)dp[i][j]=j;else if(j===0)dp[i][j]=i;else if(a[i-1]===b[j-1])dp[i][j]=dp[i-1][j-1];else dp[i][j]=Math.min(dp[i-1][j],dp[i][j-1],dp[i-1][j-1])+1;steps.push([i,j,dp[i][j]])}}let k=0,timer;function clearMarks(){Object.values(cells).forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('current','source','answer'))}function play(){clearInterval(timer);Object.values(cells).forEach(x=>{x.className='cell';x.firstElementChild.textContent='·'});k=0;timer=setInterval(frame,1700);frame()}function frame(){if(k>=steps.length){clearMarks();cells['5-3'].classList.add('answer');status.innerHTML='<strong>答案：dp[5][3] = 3</strong><br>horse 变成 ros 最少需要 3 次操作。';clearInterval(timer);setTimeout(play,3000);return}clearMarks();const [i,j,v]=steps[k++],cur=cells[i+'-'+j];cur.firstElementChild.textContent=v;cur.classList.add('current','done');if(i===0||j===0){status.innerHTML='<strong>初始化边界 dp['+i+']['+j+'] = '+v+'</strong><br>一边为空时，只能连续'+(i===0?'插入':'删除')+'字符。'}else{const same=a[i-1]===b[j-1],src=same?[[i-1,j-1]]:[[i-1,j],[i,j-1],[i-1,j-1]];src.forEach(p=>cells[p[0]+'-'+p[1]].classList.add('source'));status.innerHTML='<strong>比较 '+a[i-1]+' 与 '+b[j-1]+'</strong><br>'+(same?'字符相同，继承左上角：'+v:'字符不同，在删除、插入、替换中取最小值再加 1，得到 '+v)+'。'}}play();</script></body></html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
,"time_complexity":"O((m + 1)(n + 1))","space_complexity":"O((m + 1)(n + 1))","complexity_note":"m、n 为两个单词长度. 演示保留包括空前缀边界的二维 dp 表, 每格最多比较三个来源; 非空时通常写作 O(mn). 只求距离时可滚动到 O(min(m, n) + 1) 空间."}
